        "PMC9646780::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Interfacial short-range order and lattice distortion alter the energy barriers for dislocation nucleation and transmission.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11032334::web::019::indentation_force_and_hardness",
        "PMC12964539::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC12964539::web::022::dislocation_activities_at_atomic_scale_a",
        "PMC9636235::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting material is a nanoscale multilayer coating containing mixed FCC and BCC HEA phases.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting HEA multilayers possess compositional complexity, lattice distortion, and a baseline level of short-range order.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11032334::web::001::introduction",
        "PMC8866532::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC9636235::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Changing nanoscale layer thickness and interfacial composition can modify the degree and spatial distribution of interfacial short-range order and lattice distortion.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9636235::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Controlled heat treatment can alter short-range order in concentrated alloys.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9636235::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mechanical loading can modify the degree or local state of short-range order.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10873362::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC9646780::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enhanced short-range order increases the force or energy required for dislocation nucleation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11032334::web::019::indentation_force_and_hardness"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enhanced lattice distortion increases the local barrier to dislocation nucleation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Short-range-ordered structures can pin dislocations and restrict their mobility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11032334::web::019::indentation_force_and_hardness"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Severe lattice distortion can impede long-range dislocation glide.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12964539::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC12964539::web::022::dislocation_activities_at_atomic_scale_a"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increased dislocation barriers at the interfaces delay the onset of macroscopic creep.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Restricted dislocation motion promotes gradual accumulation of localized plastic deformation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10873362::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC12964539::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC12964539::web::022::dislocation_activities_at_atomic_scale_a"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
